            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "TwoSweetPickles"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I love this! I am out of thyme...have lots of fresh, but no dried, but even without it, it's great. The smoked paprika is the key, I think. Next time I shop, I'll pick up some dried thyme and add it to the mix.",
            "datePublished": "2011-03-17T17:48:04.547Z"
